OL,3,GNEWSAWater returns for thousands after
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater has returned to thousands of
OL,7,Fhomes in West Sussex after a leak
OL,8,Fcaused supply issues and shut roads
OL,9,Fover the weekend.
OL,11,FRoads were closed near the Southgate
OL,12,FRoundabout in Crawley, while as many as
OL,13,F9,000 customers were left without water
OL,14,Fat the height of the outage.
OL,16,FA Southern Water spokesperson confirmed
OL,17,Fon Monday morning that the burst pipe
OL,18,Fhad been repaired overnight, and that
OL,19,Fwater had been restored to all
OL,20,Fcustomers.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
